Very easy to get bored while playing this. \r\n\r\nThe animations aren't that great, and the gameplay is not that satisfying either. Doesn't matter which difficulty you choose, you'll get bored by the time you get to the 3rd stage (there are about 5 total). On top of that, it's not even randomly generated. Every stage is the same, every run.\r\n\r\nOn top of that, the devs said that they'd give us 5 free-to-download updates. They're thinking of monetizing every update after those 5 free-to-download ones. Just ridiculous.\r\n\r\nThe comic-like artstyle is cool, but it doesn't add anything to a game like this. The devs are not utilizing this artstyle in any way (for example, they could have used some retro-comic sounds to utilize the artstyle in an original way). It would make no difference to me if the artstyle was one day spontaneously swapped for another artsyle.", "timestamp_created": 1711220044, "timestamp_updated": 1711220044, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.420806556940078735", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}